Definitions

   "The Software" means the Doqua library: its source code, compiled binaries
   and documentation.

   "Your Product" means any product, library, framework, tool or service that
   you develop, commercial or not, other than Examples, Demos and Teaching
   Materials.

   "Example or Demo" means an application, sample, tutorial or demonstration
   whose purpose is to show, explain, test or promote Your Product, for example
   a sample application that shows how to use your library, a demo program
   shipped with your SDK, or a program used to present Your Product.

   "Teaching Materials" means books, articles, courses, lessons, workshops,
   videos, exercises and similar material for teaching or learning, together
   with the sample programs that come with them.

